// An `if` whose written answer disagrees with its arms. Where nothing states
// its type the answer is not read yet (#2089), so the run target is refused
// as not synthesisable before its arms meet the answer.

/// `-> -F String` written over integer arms (#2089).
@[ refuses("NotSynthesisable") ]
if true -> -F String { pure 1 } else { pure 2 }
